  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SHIP Liberia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal of the project is to improving health outcomes of school age children through providing refractive error, deworming and general eye health services in the project counties. As part of our commitment to continuum of care, the project will continue to strengthen the referral system to ensure children with other ocular morbidities are able to access high quality services at the designated referral centres. These would include children with paediatric cataract and other conditions that would be identified during vision screening.</narrative>
  </description>
